aragraph\" ><strong>Character Creator System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Character Creator System allows each player to create their own Unique Character by customizing different body parts and cosmetics of their character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151010/extras/4831d3c8494768a6722798bd25eb3c0f.poster.avif?t=1729055494\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151010/extras/4831d3c8494768a6722798bd25eb3c0f.webm?t=1729055494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151010/extras/4831d3c8494768a6722798bd25eb3c0f.mp4?t=1729055494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Character Creator enforces that there can only exist one unique character of a type, which means no same character with combination of body parts/cosmetics used can be created again, making sure each and every character in Soul Kira will always be unique (looking).</p>",
